<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 300 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 300 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 300 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>The Bank ssid 120 million stg was in bills offered outright which will mature on or before March 18. The remaining 180 million comprised a repo which will run to March 18.</p>
<p>A total of 700 million stg in liquidity has been offered so far on Tuesday, matching the money market shortage forecast.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
